 ## care_event 实现细节
 
-待填写。
+DB Schema (`care_events`):
+```
+event_id TEXT PRIMARY KEY
+subject_id TEXT NOT NULL
+room TEXT NOT NULL (归一化大写)
+bed TEXT NOT NULL (归一化大写)
+kind TEXT NOT NULL
+title TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT ''
+content TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT ''
